  () => agent(`${base}\n\nLENS: SSE CONSUMER CORRECTNESS. Verify useAgentStream: does it handle BOTH default onmessage frames AND named info/error events? Does it close the EventSource on unmount (no leak)? Bounded reconnect (no tight loop)? Does it cap buffer growth? Does a tool.result/study.done trigger a study query refetch so the run table updates? Does runtime_unavailable render a clean state, not an error spinner? Read the hook + AgentActivity + StudyDetail wiring. Report concrete defects.`, { label: 'verify:sse', phase: 'Verify', schema: VERDICT }),
